{"id":"stockholm-bus-203-naset","group":"stockholm-bus-203","city":"Stockholm","mode":"bus","line":"203","vehicle":"buss","vehicleLong":"buss","operator":"SL","api":"sl","tab":"","guide":null,"speedKmh":18,"dwellSec":15,"route":[[59.357371,18.103223],[59.357061,18.105094],[59.356871,18.105433],[59.356687,18.105505],[59.356618,18.104608],[59.356854,18.104229],[59.357549,18.104649],[59.358224,18.105868],[59.361859,18.113547],[59.362713,18.115895],[59.363001,18.117124],[59.363048,18.118019],[59.362987,18.118681],[59.362687,18.118876],[59.362465,18.118633],[59.362477,18.118145],[59.362759,18.11679],[59.36315,18.115669],[59.363593,18.115175],[59.364326,18.114975],[59.365299,18.115153],[59.366175,18.11559],[59.367123,18.11679],[59.369153,18.121251],[59.369118,18.121384],[59.369182,18.121283],[59.370389,18.123732],[59.370794,18.125533],[59.371049,18.129878],[59.370922,18.1344],[59.370877,18.141792],[59.370965,18.144378],[59.371198,18.146942],[59.371506,18.146968],[59.372334,18.147487],[59.372322,18.147627],[59.372336,18.147495],[59.373017,18.14735],[59.373409,18.146891],[59.373568,18.146265],[59.373577,18.145739],[59.373278,18.143995],[59.373151,18.141984],[59.373247,18.140902],[59.373389,18.140323],[59.373567,18.140257]],"stops":[{"name":"Ropsten","lat":59.357371,"lon":18.103223,"story":"Välkommen ombord på buss 203 mot Näset! Resan tar ungefär 17 minuter. Från Ropsten går Lidingöbanan över Lidingöbron ut till Lidingö. Bron öppnade 1925 och var länge den enda landförbindelsen till ön.","tips":[["Utsikt mot Lidingö","2 min"]],"dur":15.1,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Liding%C3%B6bron_2010-04-17.jpg/1280px-Liding%C3%B6bron_2010-04-17.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Esquilo","license":"CC BY 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liding%C3%B6bron_2010-04-17.jpg","title":"A tram-car on Lidingöbanan passing Lidingöbron.","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron%2C_maj_2021_03.jpg/1280px-Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron%2C_maj_2021_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron,_maj_2021_03.jpg","title":"Lilla Lidingöbron, byggarbeten i maj 2021","near":true},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron%2C_maj_2021_05.jpg/1280px-Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron%2C_maj_2021_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lilla_Liding%C3%B6bron,_maj_2021_05.jpg","title":"Lilla Lidingöbron, byggarbeten i maj 2021","near":true}],"audio":"audio/piper/f22498c9e41f0c27.mp3"},{"name":"Constantiavägen","lat":59.369118,"lon":18.121384,"story":"Det gamla torpet Islinge gård har gett namn åt hela kommundelen Islinge på nordvästra Lidingö. Vid Lilla Värtan, söder om Islingeviken, står Torsviks fyr, även kallad Islingefyren, som anlades 1950 och släcktes 1980 men fortfarande fungerar som referens för målgången i kappseglingen Lidingö Runt. I området ligger också konstskolan Nyckelviksskolan, med utbildningar inom konst, konsthantverk, arkitektur och design.","tips":[["Nyckelviksskolan","5 min"]],"dur":26.0,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Nyckelviksskolan.JPG/1280px-Nyckelviksskolan.JPG?utm_source=sv.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Udo Schröter","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nyckelviksskolan.JPG","title":"Nyckelviksskolan"}],"audio":"audio/piper/3e2ff50ecb8b3468.mp3"},{"name":"Dalängen","lat":59.370921,"lon":18.128563,"story":"Alldeles intill, vid Norra Kungsvägen, står en del av en runsten, Upplands runinskrift 172. Den är en av bara två runinskrifter som hittats på Lidingö; den andra upptäcktes 1984 i närheten av Bo gård. En bit bort ligger Villa Backen, som Ivar Tengbom ritade åt August och Célie Brunius och som stod klar 1910.","tips":[["Runstenen vid Dalängen","1 min"]],"dur":20.4,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Lidingo_runsten.JPG/1280px-Lidingo_runsten.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Udo Schröter","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lidingo_runsten.JPG","title":"Lidingo runsten"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Villa_Backen%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_okt_2021a.jpg/1280px-Villa_Backen%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_okt_2021a.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Villa_Backen,_Liding%C3%B6,_okt_2021a.jpg","title":"Villa Backen, Lidingö, okt 2021a"}],"audio":"audio/piper/ff6ba66b8613e75a.mp3"},{"name":"Ägirvägen","lat":59.370851,"lon":18.13498},{"name":"Högnäsvägen","lat":59.372322,"lon":18.147627,"story":"En bit härifrån, på Klockargårdens skolas skolgård, leker Carl Milles elefanter: skulpturgruppen Lekande elefanter har stått där sedan 1947. Skolan själv är kommunens äldsta i drift, med anor från 1843. Längs Stockholmsvägen i Näset finns också Näsets krog, en bevarad vägkrog från 1700-talet, och Villa Nynäs, som från 1879 till 1912 rymde det som troligen var Lidingös första handelsbod.","tips":[["Lekande elefanter","6 min"]],"dur":27.4,"images":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_apri_2022c.jpg/1280px-Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_apri_2022c.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola,_Liding%C3%B6,_apri_2022c.jpg","title":"Klockargårdens skola, Lidingö, apri 2022c"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_apri_2022.jpg/1280px-Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_apri_2022.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Klockarg%C3%A5rdens_skola,_Liding%C3%B6,_apri_2022.jpg","title":"Klockargårdens skola, Lidingö, apri 2022"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/N%C3%A4sets_krog%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_sept_2021a.jpg/1280px-N%C3%A4sets_krog%2C_Liding%C3%B6%2C_sept_2021a.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Holger.Ellgaard","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:N%C3%A4sets_krog,_Liding%C3%B6,_sept_2021a.jpg","title":"Näsets krog, Lidingö, sept 2021a"}],"audio":"audio/piper/09cd7b9f119ba2d8.mp3"},{"name":"Källängstorget","lat":59.373342,"lon":18.144073},{"name":"Näset","lat":59.373567,"lon":18.140257,"story":"Snart är vi framme vid ändhållplatsen Näset. Tack för att du åkte med!","tips":[],"dur":4.1,"audio":"audio/piper/476d1c5ec880dd1c.mp3"}],"looks":[],"from":"Ropsten","to":"Näset","variant":"Mot Näset","color":["#d71d24","#ffffff"],"trips":278,"source":"SL via Trafiklab (GTFS Regional)","tts":"Piper"}